&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=871442288d3572747cd56379945f56f3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a857a516/uploads/origins/e53c6769-a083-453c-afd9-f4fa3caaf622?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=871442288d3572747cd56379945f56f3, https://si.imgix.net/a857a516/uploads/origins/e53c6769-a083-453c-afd9-f4fa3caaf622?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dd5a6a21c0d529384d5140207382bb6f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a857a516/uploads/origins/e53c6769-a083-453c-afd9-f4fa3caaf622?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8ea3c08ed3115bf626cabd21858c1a99 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "アピールありがとうございます！\n色々なシチュ考えて下さって助かります！\n是非うちの子のイラストおねがいします！\n\n内容などは全てお任せしたいです！\nアピールにあったシチュでも新しく思いついたものでもかまいません。\n是非宜しくお願いします\n\nhttps://skeb.jp/@kukuru_ksk\nhttps://twitter.com/kukuru_ksk/status/1582536783140511744\nhttps://twitter.com/kukuru_ksk/status/1582668907256479744\nhttps://twitter.com/kukuru_ksk/status/1465361611791630336\nhttps://twitter.com/kukuru_ksk/status/1465361558326812674", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hako_sketch/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b850008e/uploads/origins/3a3e31a8-97a7-4821-85c7-eb7d2b9f132e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c32c7b1682a908af474ea0c16217ad22", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b850008e/uploads/origins/3a3e31a8-97a7-4821-85c7-eb7d2b9f132e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c32c7b1682a908af474ea0c16217ad22, https://si.imgix.net/b850008e/uploads/origins/3a3e31a8-97a7-4821-85c7-eb7d2b9f132e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b901e3faa188e56514c9f8053c33558e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b850008e/uploads/origins/3a3e31a8-97a7-4821-85c7-eb7d2b9f132e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c3f9b5572aee3ecb86e5c7789a9081b1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! \n\nI am creating an album, would you be able to create an album cover for me? \n\nHere is a link to the songs, for inspiration: https://www.dropbox.com/sh/8oajmex8ivd7hod/AAB1rkAZfYgCiDzvGOqKzP5ma?dl=0&fbclid=IwAR2WLVrVfD17P7s57YfgIeAabS_EP-920OhJuj9Z6J6dEmyZR7Nee68EFXw \n\n(these songs are a work in progress)\n\nI would like something dark and moody. A cyberpunk nature-y background with a character or two that are \"sad\" looking.\n\nYou can take many creative liberties, I will be happy with anything you send because I love your art!\n\nThank you, I hope you will accept my request!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}